    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On a small island lives a girl called Lily. Her world is turned upside down when she comes into contact with a mysterious seashell and finds herself being able to travel across space and time. However, there is another being inside Lily and the two will have to work together to find a way out and return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by titles such as <strong>CHRONO TRIGGER,</strong> <strong>TERRANIGMA </strong>and\u00a0<strong>ECCO THE DOLPHIN</strong> <i>NAUTILUS EPOCH</i> combines the best of story-driven RPGs with endless mysteries of the deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0<strong>A UNIQUE\u00a0</strong>battle system which involves mastering different gameplay systems</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Collect FATHOMS to make contact with ANIMA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Alight the star constellations of each ANIMA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Use both words and symbology to capture each ANIMA</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE</strong> a multitude of environments from different time periods of earth's history painted using real watercolors</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A GRIPPING STORY</strong> of survival and human co-existence with other species and nature\u00a0</h2>",
